     kkllddnneexxtt — return the fileid of the next kld file

LLIIBBRRAARRYY
     Standard C Library (libc, -lc)

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     ##iinncclluuddee <<ssyyss//lliinnkkeerr..hh>>

     _i_n_t
